paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Major improvements and adjustments from the mobile version</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Steam version includes the difficulty level and features we originally wanted, and we've added systems and adjusted the balance in various ways, including the difficulty setting function, so that even those who have played the mobile version extensively can enjoy it in a new way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game progresses at a good pace, and you can now obtain many tokens needed for unlocking and strengthening, allowing you to collect them smoothly throughout the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the latter half of the high difficulty setting, extremely powerful attack patterns have been added to the bosses, so you may have to retry many times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The difficulty level can be changed at any time from the title screen, so feel free to give it a try.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Distribution guidelines</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- You are free to post videos and live streams of this game, including monetization, as long as you follow basic morals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- There is no need to contact us in advance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- We would appreciate it if you could include the store page (the URL of this page).</p>",
